<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Spanish first division after games played on Sunday.</p>
<p>7-Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>5-Guilherme (Rayo Vallecano)</p>
<p>4-Alfonso Perez (Real Betis), Rivaldo (Deportivo), Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao), Oli Alvarez (Oviedo), Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid), Romario (Valencia), Gustavo Poyet (Zaragoza).</p>
